type: software
title: "Deterministic Document Orchestrator"
abstract: >-
  An AI-augmented document engine that transforms structured YAML source files into
  reproducible PDFs, HTML, and Markdown via a strict 5-phase pipeline with mandatory
  human-in-the-loop gates and a zero-hallucination constraint.
